    "bg": "00013",
    "bgm": "041"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういえば、感謝祭の後、あの剣はどうしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020010,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "クローゼットにしまいました！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "来るべき日まで、再び封印をかけておくんです……！",
    "charAnim1": "hero2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな\r\n勇者の剣には、次の活躍の時まで力を蓄えてもらうわけだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……今度使う時には、また小さくなってるかもなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "──はっ\r\nほ、本当です……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしがちゃんと大人になれてたら、\r\nあの剣はまた小さくなっちゃいます……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それ、果穂はどう思う？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_a",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大好きだったものが、だんだん小さくなっていくこと──\r\n何か感じるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "それは……えーっと……\r\n最初に見た時は、ちょっとびっくりしました……？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも、それであの剣が変わるわけじゃありません！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "小さくなってもキラキラでカッコいいし、\r\n感謝祭ではあたしに力をくれました！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だから、もう一度封印を解いた時だって、\r\n幼稚園の時とも、今とも一緒です！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、また大きくなったんだよって言ったら、\r\n変わらずに遊ぶんです！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──そうか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──それじゃあ、今度会う時までに、\r\nもっと大きな小宮果穂になっておかなきゃな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "た、確かにです……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "もっと大きなあたし……\r\nプロデューサーさんよりも背が高くなってるでしょうか！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、果穂ならあり得るかもなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020160,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも、プロデューサーさんも\r\n大きくなってるかもですよね……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（はは……それはないだろうけど──）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺より大きくなるんだったら、\r\nよく食べて、よく体を動かして、よく眠らないとな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020170,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そ、そういえばお腹が空きました……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……これは特別な情報だけど、はづきさんが今朝、\r\nとっておきのおやつを仕入れたと教えてくれた",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_a",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──さて、果穂\r\nよく体を動かすか！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020190,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900202/1009002020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009002020200,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、事務所まで競争ですよっ！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
